#. Description of the plugin
#: collapsi-for-gutenberg.php
msgid "Editor-only collapse/expand toggle for every Gutenberg block. Hover a top-level block, click the chevron, and the block tucks into a compact bar with icon, title, and content preview. Survives reloads via localStorage. Works in Post Editor and Site Editor. No frontend impact."
msgstr ""

